Package: libdrm2
Version: @DEB_LIBDRM_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://dri.freedesktop.org/
Description: Direct Rendering Manager library (iOS links-only shim)
 iOS has no DRM/KMS. This is a links-only stub of libdrm so consumers that
 reference @rpath/libdrm.dylib (Xwayland, mutter) resolve it at load time. The
 DRM/dma-buf code path is inert; GPU buffers go through IOSurface instead.
